OL,5,G1655 Love Nature
OL,6,     FWe follow Sally from
OL,7,     FNorthamptonshire Badger Group as
OL,8,     Fshe checks on an urban badger
OL,9,     Fsetts tucked between houses,
OL,10,     Fgardens and busy roads.
OL,11,G1700 5 News with Dan Walker
OL,12,G1800 Cyprus: Jewel of the Med
OL,13,     FWe visit stunning Cyprus. With 11
OL,14,     Fmonths of sunshine, beautiful
OL,15,     Fbeaches and crystal-clear waters,
OL,16,     Fit's no wonder this former
OL,17,     Fplayground for the reek Gods
OL,18,     Fattracts four million visitors a
OL,19,     Fyear.
