OL,5,G1900 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FWith reoffending rates on the rise
OL,7,     Fin the UK, we follow the Traffic
OL,8,     FCops as they are increasingly
OL,9,     Ffaced with seasoned criminals,
OL,10,     Fexperienced at evading the law.
OL,11,G2000 Street Cops: Catching the Yobs
OL,12,     FPolice Spaniel Bonnie is called in
OL,13,     Fto sniff out narcotics. Cops deal
OL,14,     Fwith an aggressive bloke who
OL,15,     Frefuses to go quietly. And a
OL,16,     Fsuspected drink driver spurns a
OL,17,     Fbreathalyser.
