OL,5,G2100 Fare Dodgers: At War with the Law
OL,6,     FIn Nottingham, agents are pushed
OL,7,     Fto the limit by vaping 'tram
OL,8,     Fsurfers' causing trouble on the
OL,9,     Ftracks. In London, investigators
OL,10,     Fhunt a woman thought to owe more
OL,11,     Fthan #2k in fares (S3)
OL,12,G2200 Police Interceptors:...
OL,13,     F...Taking Down the Shoplifting
OL,14,     FGangs. Police piece together
OL,15,     Fincriminating clips to tackle
OL,16,     Fsuspects linked to a crime group.
OL,17,     FIn Burnley, cops pursue prolific
OL,18,     Fshoplifting suspects.
